description:
8bit-Robots' Voice Beatbox. The robots will be making beats as if they were having a conversation with each other, and will be enlivening the dance floor.

Each of the three layers ( DROID-Types, MELOID-Types and RYTHOID-Types ) is set up with three items each. Discover the mixes that Async art creates that we never imagined.
We are also a group that imagines new art by combining Chiptune / 8bit sound trackmaking with character creation and processing art to match these sounds.

